(4608180, 664960, 84656, '<td valign="top">Predominant colour (yellow) is warm rather than cool, so think you will receive a few DNMC''s.<br/> <br/>Like the way your DOF has isolated a single flower, would prefer the face of the daffodil to be towards the camera though.</td>', 'Predominant colour (yellow) is warm rather than cool, so think you will receive a few DNMC''s. Like the way your DOF has isolated a single flower, would prefer the face of the daffodil to be towards the camera though.', '2008-04-02 18:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
