(4618163, 665051, 68035, '<td valign="top">I have to confess to generally not being a huge fan of studio shots but this one has a wonderous simplicity and beauty that just over powers my petty prejudices<br/> <br/>Stunning composition and a beautiful array of cool blue tones<br/> <br/>A great great image - but I get the feeling that you probably already knew that. 9 from me</td>', 'I have to confess to generally not being a huge fan of studio shots but this one has a wonderous simplicity and beauty that just over powers my petty prejudices Stunning composition and a beautiful array of cool blue tones A great great image - but I get the feeling that you probably already knew that. 9 from me', '2008-04-06 11:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
