(4620689, 663743, 90658, '<td valign="top">Greens are tough...too much yellow and you have a warm green, too much blue and you have cool green.  I think there is just enough of each that this could go either way, meaning you are probably going to get comments that this is warm.  But I see the cool hues in it, so good job going out on that limb.</td>', 'Greens are tough...too much yellow and you have a warm green, too much blue and you have cool green.  I think there is just enough of each that this could go either way, meaning you are probably going to get comments that this is warm.  But I see the cool hues in it, so good job going out on that limb.', '2008-04-07 10:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4620690, 663801, 90658, '<td valign="top">I love the "framing" achieved by shooting this the way you did.  It gives a very distant feel.  Like you can almost get to the beach, but can''t.  Also, the darkness in the front adds emphasis to the cool blues.</td>', 'I love the "framing" achieved by shooting this the way you did.  It gives a very distant feel.  Like you can almost get to the beach, but can''t.  Also, the darkness in the front adds emphasis to the cool blues.', '2008-04-07 10:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4620692, 664402, 89425, '<td valign="top">there is no significant color in this picture, and the challenge is about color.</td>', 'there is no significant color in this picture, and the challenge is about color.', '2008-04-07 10:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4620693, 663915, 90658, '<td valign="top">Greens, cool or warm, depending.  I think your leaves are actually warm greens (lots of yellow undertones), but your background green is the cool color.  So what to do with this?</td>', 'Greens, cool or warm, depending.  I think your leaves are actually warm greens (lots of yellow undertones), but your background green is the cool color.  So what to do with this?', '2008-04-07 10:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
