(4620706, 664645, 90658, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  The differeing hues of the blues added with just a touch of the warm red &amp; yellow, makes this very pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'Very pretty.  The differeing hues of the blues added with just a touch of the warm red & yellow, makes this very pleasing to the eye.', '2008-04-07 11:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
