(4620710, 665018, 90658, '<td valign="top">I''m so new here, I don''t see the homage, but that is me.  This picture has an impact, for me, not based on how you got the idea; but because the idea is simple.</td>', 'I''m so new here, I don''t see the homage, but that is me.  This picture has an impact, for me, not based on how you got the idea; but because the idea is simple.', '2008-04-07 11:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4620711, 664960, 89425, '<td valign="top">the concept here is weak, and yellow is a warm color.</td>', 'the concept here is weak, and yellow is a warm color.', '2008-04-07 11:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4620715, 663037, 90658, '<td valign="top">If you could have shot this against any other cool color background, you would have achieved a much deeper dimension to this.  The white is actually muting the colors of the stones.  After the challenge, play with your RAW and see if using purple/lavender, cool green or a royal blue in the background changes the impact.</td>', 'If you could have shot this against any other cool color background, you would have achieved a much deeper dimension to this.  The white is actually muting the colors of the stones.  After the challenge, play with your RAW and see if using purple/lavender, cool green or a royal blue in the background changes the impact.', '2008-04-07 11:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4620718, 664713, 90658, '<td valign="top">This is actually pretty stunning.  Well done (I''m assuming this was done with editing, as I don''t think they''ve actually created a blue rose yet...at least not this blue.)</td>', 'This is actually pretty stunning.  Well done (I''m assuming this was done with editing, as I don''t think they''ve actually created a blue rose yet...at least not this blue.)', '2008-04-07 11:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
