(4620772, 664520, 90658, '<td valign="top">Very nice still life.  I love the detail within the beads...you could have so easily just dropped them in the vase, but you went to the trouble to evenly disperse them and add the dimension of lining them up.</td>', 'Very nice still life.  I love the detail within the beads...you could have so easily just dropped them in the vase, but you went to the trouble to evenly disperse them and add the dimension of lining them up.', '2008-04-07 11:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
