(4620800, 663938, 89431, '<td valign="top">Those are really pretty eyes, and ti like the way you croped this. I also like how the whole photo is black &amp; white except for the eyes.</td>', 'Those are really pretty eyes, and ti like the way you croped this. I also like how the whole photo is black & white except for the eyes.', '2008-04-07 11:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
