(4625766, 664808, 30982, '<td valign="top">Damn fine shot for a camera phone.  Superb composition and atmosphere.  Just goes to show it ain''t the equipment.</td>', 'Damn fine shot for a camera phone.  Superb composition and atmosphere.  Just goes to show it ain''t the equipment.', '2008-04-09 04:16:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4625767, 664695, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''ll just offer a "huh?" on the score thing.  I''ve given up on the whole why thing.  Brilliant idea, equally awesome execution.  And it seems to me you can be whoever you want to be - every picture I see of you is different.  Very well done, young lady.</td>', 'I''ll just offer a "huh?" on the score thing.  I''ve given up on the whole why thing.  Brilliant idea, equally awesome execution.  And it seems to me you can be whoever you want to be - every picture I see of you is different.  Very well done, young lady.', '2008-04-09 04:19:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4625773, 663456, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL - I typed "greens are tough" then saw your other comment.  But greens ARE tough - to me they can be cool or they can be warm, depending on the amount of yellow or blue in them.  That''s from a quilter''s perspective, though.  I think most probably accepted this as "cool" because it''s green and green has been declared "cool" - but it has both warm and cool tones to it, and that may have swayed a few voters.  What kind of plants are these?  They almost look like two little faces laughing and having a conversation.</td>', 'LOL - I typed "greens are tough" then saw your other comment.  But greens ARE tough - to me they can be cool or they can be warm, depending on the amount of yellow or blue in them.  That''s from a quilter''s perspective, though.  I think most probably accepted this as "cool" because it''s green and green has been declared "cool" - but it has both warm and cool tones to it, and that may have swayed a few voters.  What kind of plants are these?  They almost look like two little faces laughing and having a conversation.', '2008-04-09 04:23:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4625779, 664452, 30982, '<td valign="top">Yes, this falls into the cool toned palette despite the "red" - red can be warm (if it has yellow) or cool (if it has blue).  We needed more of the voters to have worked with textiles, with design - if you were to design a room with this color scheme, it would most definitely be "cool".  And cool can be vibrant.  Awesome macro by the way.  Incredibly rich, wonderful bokeh patterns.</td>', 'Yes, this falls into the cool toned palette despite the "red" - red can be warm (if it has yellow) or cool (if it has blue).  We needed more of the voters to have worked with textiles, with design - if you were to design a room with this color scheme, it would most definitely be "cool".  And cool can be vibrant.  Awesome macro by the way.  Incredibly rich, wonderful bokeh patterns.', '2008-04-09 04:27:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4625782, 664010, 30982, '<td valign="top">I saw the thumbnail and knew this had to be yours.  Wonderfully shown range of greens and your signature style.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I saw the thumbnail and knew this had to be yours.  Wonderfully shown range of greens and your signature style.  Nicely done.', '2008-04-09 04:28:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4625785, 663130, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''d say you did a darn fine job with this!  Congrats on an outstanding score and very high placement.</td>', 'I''d say you did a darn fine job with this!  Congrats on an outstanding score and very high placement.', '2008-04-09 04:30:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4625786, 663449, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is lovely, Brian!  Wonderfully minimal and delicate.  Definitely cool, and projects a cool feeling very well.  Well done!</td>', 'This is lovely, Brian!  Wonderfully minimal and delicate.  Definitely cool, and projects a cool feeling very well.  Well done!', '2008-04-09 04:31:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4625791, 664768, 27845, '<td valign="top">Hey hey, congrats, nice shot.</td>', 'Hey hey, congrats, nice shot.', '2008-04-09 04:35:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4625800, 664887, 68413, '<td valign="top">Thought this was under rated Rozy - great macro - and yep, after looking at the colour wheel for about the 1 millionth time, I agree with Jason - don''t know how green could ever be classed as warm???</td>', 'Thought this was under rated Rozy - great macro - and yep, after looking at the colour wheel for about the 1 millionth time, I agree with Jason - don''t know how green could ever be classed as warm???', '2008-04-09 04:43:19.000000', NULL, 0),
