(4626677, 662461, 44557, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your kind comments and you are all right, wrong comp I think.  I was aiming more towards the water being cool and refreshing.  Heck it was my first comp and I have learned a lot, so thank you all for the critiques.</td>', 'Thank you all for your kind comments and you are all right, wrong comp I think.  I was aiming more towards the water being cool and refreshing.  Heck it was my first comp and I have learned a lot, so thank you all for the critiques.', '2008-04-09 11:25:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4626716, 664024, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh Ragga!  Yes!  This is the most beautiful display of colors ever!  CONGRATULATIONS on a ribbon to match :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh Ragga!  Yes!  This is the most beautiful display of colors ever!  CONGRATULATIONS on a ribbon to match :) ', '2008-04-09 11:37:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4626723, 664923, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh yeahhh!!!!!   Being the big fan of bees that I am. . .I think this one most DEFINITELY deserves top honors with a ribbon :)  Those fast, crazy-flight-patterned fellows are hard to catch in flight, aren''t they!  CONGRATULATIONS!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh yeahhh!!!!!   Being the big fan of bees that I am. . .I think this one most DEFINITELY deserves top honors with a ribbon :)  Those fast, crazy-flight-patterned fellows are hard to catch in flight, aren''t they!  CONGRATULATIONS! ', '2008-04-09 11:39:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4626772, 664887, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmy!  You keep getting better and better at your macros.   The detail on this is so unbelievable.   I''m so inspired to get my macro lens and learn from you!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Ohmy!  You keep getting better and better at your macros.   The detail on this is so unbelievable.   I''m so inspired to get my macro lens and learn from you!! ', '2008-04-09 11:53:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4626876, 664010, 24454, '<td valign="top">Well. . .I wonder what in the WORLD was wrong with the voters that they didn''t give this its just reward for being spectacular.    This is your signature photo, and this one was done expertly and beautifully like always!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Well. . .I wonder what in the WORLD was wrong with the voters that they didn''t give this its just reward for being spectacular.    This is your signature photo, and this one was done expertly and beautifully like always! ', '2008-04-09 12:16:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4626892, 664964, 24454, '<td valign="top">Laurie, this is beautiful.  Soft, cool, pink colors that make my heart feel fresh and happy to be in the throes of Spring!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Laurie, this is beautiful.  Soft, cool, pink colors that make my heart feel fresh and happy to be in the throes of Spring! ', '2008-04-09 12:20:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4626918, 664999, 30049, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ShutterHack:</b></div><hr/><i> blue for sure! 10 </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Based on the final votes (no 10''s) I''d say there was a grain of sarcasm in here.  :-/<br/> <br/>I did find it interesting how the bluish tarp on the hood helped to contribute to a cooler feel in this photo.<br/> <br/>Smile and keep having fun!  :-)</td>', 'Originally posted by ShutterHack: blue for sure! 10  Based on the final votes (no 10''s) I''d say there was a grain of sarcasm in here.  :-/ I did find it interesting how the bluish tarp on the hood helped to contribute to a cooler feel in this photo. Smile and keep having fun!  :-)', '2008-04-09 12:27:58.000000', NULL, 0),
