(4658324, 665110, 90495, '<td valign="top">Great shot of this bad boy. I''ve been trying to get a good shot of the couple who live in the backyard area but they''re too wise. I leave peanuts for squirrels and guess who steals them? I couldn''t believe my eyes. But as soon as they see me around, they''re gone.</td>', 'Great shot of this bad boy. I''ve been trying to get a good shot of the couple who live in the backyard area but they''re too wise. I leave peanuts for squirrels and guess who steals them? I couldn''t believe my eyes. But as soon as they see me around, they''re gone.', '2008-04-25 01:45:10.000000', NULL, 0),
